Core/Jessie: You said the city center is safer. Why?
Core/Rose: Less green space. Concrete, asphalt, buildings. The Bloom spreads slower there.
Core/Jessie: But it’s still spreading.
Core/Rose: Everything’s spreading. But the city has maybe… a few more months before it’s like the suburbs.
Core/Jessie: And then what?
Core/Rose: …Then we figure something else out.